  "result": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block-000489-427939d1",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[296]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 489,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Google Cloud has entered into a limited number of agreements to supply multiple gigawatts of TPU hardware to customers who require or provide on-premises infrastructure for specialized, high-scale workloads. Revenues for these transactions are included in our backlog as of March 31, 2026. We expect to begin recognizing revenues from these agreements later in 2026, with the significant majority to be recognized in 2027. In connection with certain of these agreements, we have agreed to provide credit backstops to support third-party data centers and power infrastructure.",
        "text_hash": "427939d1d3751150c63e69dc0da744c357d4b1485cf0bdceb87d97a8b996c36d",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000490-10772e60",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[297]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 490,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In March 2026, we committed to a $40.0 billion investment in a private company consisting of a $10.0 billion capital commitment and $30.0 billion of future capital funding contingent upon the achievement of specified operational and financial milestones.",
        "text_hash": "10772e609f6c5a7e51ef558a2fc6c23a6775c211ec83bea9f9b95176a5320c28",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000491-60f8912c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[298]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 491,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•On March 11, 2026, we completed our acquisition of Wiz for $29.5 billion, after purchase price adjustments and excluding post combination compensation arrangements. Following the close of the acquisition, the financial results are included in our consolidated financial statements within the Google Cloud segment. For additional information on the purchase price allocation, see Note 8 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 1 of this Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q.",
        "text_hash": "60f8912c1854928432206c23b55073f658b7976987c6d8901eca63f1ec72beee",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000492-90461592",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[299]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 492,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•On March 10, 2026, we completed our acquisition of Intersect for $5.9 billion, after purchase price adjustments. Following the close of the acquisition, the financial results are included in our consolidated financial statements and are allocated to our segments. For additional information on the purchase price allocation, see Note 8 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 1 of this Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q.",
        "text_hash": "9046159294cf2d2ab341a475b8fec13aa0455a698b1d1f70d14caa526e1caaba",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000493-01f9904d",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[300]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 493,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In March 2026, we entered into a definitive agreement to contribute our ownership interest in GFiber into a newly formed entity. Upon closing, we expect to receive $1.5 billion in cash, a $2.0 billion note receivable, and a 49.99% equity interest. The transaction is expected to close in late 2026. For additional information on the pending divestiture, see Note 8 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 1 of this Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q.",
        "text_hash": "01f9904d407aa0490ae6324da53d5debc10dc2e8bc831c13c8eea9bd0f3d4bf2",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000494-ce97efc9",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[301]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 494,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In February 2026, Waymo received $16.0 billion in funding, the significant majority of which was funded by Alphabet.",
        "text_hash": "ce97efc977935af7b5b380881dfcc7051a5d81b6d1227fba5049d0f175786d97",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000495-af73714a",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[302]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 495,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•In the first quarter of 2026, we issued senior unsecured notes for net proceeds of $31.1 billion, to be used for general corporate purposes.",
        "text_hash": "af73714aefb529bb7dff63c220e011aec888d58348d4edc8c734e41193378097",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000496-9e7a0854",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[303]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 496,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•OI&E of $37.7 billion for the three months ended March 31, 2026 included net gains on equity securities of $36.9 billion, primarily related to unrealized gains on our non-marketable equity securities.",
        "text_hash": "9e7a0854102213ac71248fedf75d0f51014bb1f1170264fe2424e3bf80541cec",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000497-5daebb7d",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[304]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 497,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Operating cash flow was $45.8 billion for the three months ended March 31, 2026.",
        "text_hash": "5daebb7d567bd78ce0c98c8c5672f0db96a118774467cb64638fca2969dec24d",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000498-a1e7080f",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[305]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 498,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Capital expenditures, which primarily reflected investments in technical infrastructure, were $35.7 billion for the three months ended March 31, 2026.",
        "text_hash": "a1e7080fb84b1e4b6c14805d16b66b7623e831c4e2ccbb20999dfdad7fa93ca1",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000499-ee869ab5",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[306]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 499,
        "reported_page": 39,
        "source_anchor": "i26b1b03449a346688a951eb5656ee1ac_127",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-13.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•As of March 31, 2026, we had 194,668 employees.",
        "text_hash": "ee869ab58b4572d7cb3f471dccd1195305a78b348d44c6edbb539fe21bacf4d9",
        "type": "list_item"
      }
    ],
